@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create a class
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Class 6 - Morning Shift", "totalSeats": 120 }

### Create a class - invalid (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "totalSeats": 0 }

### List classes with seat breakdown
GET {{baseUrl}}/classes

### Get one class (replace the id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/classes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Apply for a seat (replace the class id) - 201, or 409 if full / already applied
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/holds
X-Student-Id: 20152691234567890

### Apply without student id (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/classes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/holds

### Get a hold (replace the hold id) - status becomes EXPIRED once expiresAt passes
GET {{baseUrl}}/holds/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Pay admission fee (replace the hold id) - 200 CONFIRMED; repeat is safe
POST {{baseUrl}}/holds/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/confirm
X-Student-Id: 20152691234567890

### Cancel application (replace the hold id) - 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/holds/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
X-Student-Id: 20152691234567890

### All applications of this student, newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/holds
X-Student-Id: 20152691234567890
